<title>HONG KONG: Shares of Chun Tai debut at HK$1.30/shr.</title>
<headline>Shares of Chun Tai debut at HK$1.30/shr.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of consumer electronics products maker Chun Tai Holdings Ltd made their trading debut at HK$1.30 per share on Monday compared with an issue price of HK$1.03 each.</p>
</text>
